WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.056
Meet AIAssist, an AI chatbot for
your website.

00:00:04.296 --> 00:00:07.227
Answer visitor questions and
turn chats into leads.

00:00:08.147 --> 00:00:10.635
Set your chatbot’s instructions
in AI Config.

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:13.048
Add your business documents in
the Knowledge tab.

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:16.647
Copy the embed code and paste it
into your website.

00:00:16.887 --> 00:00:19.400
Visitors can ask questions right
on your site.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.901
Your chatbot can ask for a name
and phone number.

00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:25.488
Open Leads to see who asked for
a follow-up.

00:00:26.408 --> 00:00:29.173
Review what visitors asked in
Conversations.

00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:32.516
Use Analytics to track how many
chats became leads.

00:00:33.436 --> 00:00:36.958
With AIAssist, your website can
answer questions and capture leads.

00:00:37.198 --> 00:00:39.207
Your team can pick up the
conversation from there.
